faceid-nim (1.1.1-1) jammy; urgency=medium

  * Universal install fixes: Architecture amd64 -> any (CI already built
    arm64, install.sh already accepted it); release.yml now builds amd64
    AND arm64 on Ubuntu 22.04 so one artifact installs on 22.04 and newer
    instead of noble-only; install.sh version pin moved to a single
    PKG_VERSION (1.1.1-1) with leading-v stripping so tags (v1.1.1) and
    deb versions (1.1.1-1) both resolve; Maintainer set to the real
    upstream address with Vcs-Git/Vcs-Browser for Launchpad/PPA.

