faceid-nim (1.0.0-1) noble; urgency=medium

  * First public release.
  * Lock-screen animation rebuilt as a circular HUD (arena scanner)
    with success and failure result cards; opening-animation and scan
    style options now appear on the lock screen.
  * Hybrid/IR liveness gated on real IR hardware; RGB-only machines
    resolve to mode:rgb and never attempt IR analysis.
  * Moire attack detection, camera sensor deduplication, scan audit
    fields, opening-animations engine.

 -- Gaurav <gaurav@example.invalid>  Mon, 21 Sep 2026 21:38:26 +0545

faceid-nim (0.1.0-1) noble; urgency=low

  * Initial pre-alpha release.
  * Face unlock via PAM, backed by a root daemon and an unprivileged
    vision worker, with a GNOME Shell lock-screen pill.
  * Installed disabled: the PAM profile ships Default: no and face
    unlock stays off until enabled in the Face Unlock app.
  * Model files are not bundled; fetch them with
    `faceid-nim fetch-models`, which verifies every SHA-256 from
    /usr/share/faceid-nim/models/manifest.toml.

 -- Gaurav <gaurav@example.invalid>  Sun, 20 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0545
